    PATCH /api/users/:id/activate
    Authorization: Bearer ADMIN Token
    Expected: ✓ User Activated

    4.4 Deactivate User
    PATCH /api/users/:id/deactivate
    Authorization: Bearer ADMIN Token
    Expected: ✓ User Deactivated

